  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:4;background:white'><span style='font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>The intent of City of\nPrince George snow and ice control operations is to maintain municipal roads,\nsidewalks, civic facilities and parks in a passable condition. Snow and ice\ncontrol services are not intended to eliminate all hazardous conditions on city\nroads, sidewalks, civic parking lots or parks at all times. They are intended\nto assist vehicles that are properly equipped for winter driving conditions and\nbeing operated in a manner consistent with good winter driving habits, and to\nassist pedestrians walking with care and attention to conditions.</span><br /></p><p style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\nnormal;background:white'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4C4C4C'>\n<br />\nIt is expected that under normal winter conditions, there will be situations\nwhen the immediate demand for snow and ice control services will exceed the\navailable resources. In order to maximize the benefits of operations, snow and\nice control forces shall conduct operations according to the following\npriorities:<br />\n<br />\n</span><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:red'>Priority 1</span></b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4C4C4C'><br />\n</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:red'>To be completed within<b> 48\nhours</b> of the end of snow event.</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\ncolor:#4C4C4C'><br />\n</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:red'>A. Arterial roads and\ncurb-adjacent sidewalks.<br />\nB. Downtown Central Business District roads, laneways, and sidewalks.<br />\nC. The Hospital District.<br />\nD. Major facility entrances, pedestrian surfaces, and daily parking areas.<br />\nE. City off-street parking.<br />\n<br />\n</span><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:seagreen'>Priority 2</span></b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4C4C4C'><br />\n</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:forestgreen'>To be completed\nwithin <b>48 hours</b> of the end of snow event. All bus routes that\nare non main arterial roads, and all commercial/industrial roads</span></p>\n\n<p style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\nnormal;background:white'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\ncolor:forestgreen'>A.</span><span style='font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#333333;background:white'> </span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:forestgreen'>Collector roads and curb-adjacent\nsidewalks.</span></p>\n\n<p style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\nnormal;background:white'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\ncolor:forestgreen'>B.</span><span style='font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#333333;background:white'> </span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:forestgreen'>Priority hills.</span></p>\n\n<p style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\nnormal;background:white'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\ncolor:forestgreen'>C.</span><span style='font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#333333;background:white'> </span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:forestgreen'>Commercial and industrial zoning\nroads, laneways, and curb-adjacent sidewalks.</span></p>\n\n<p style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\nnormal;background:white'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\ncolor:forestgreen'>D.</span><span style='font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#333333;background:white'> </span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:forestgreen'>Transit bus routes that are not\nin Priority One routes.</span></p>\n\n<p style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\nnormal;background:white'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\ncolor:forestgreen'>E.</span><span style='font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#333333;background:white'> </span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:forestgreen'>Transit bus stops along Priority\nOne routes.</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4C4C4C'><br />\n<br />\n</span><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:dimgray'>Priority 3</span></b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4C4C4C'><br />\n</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:dimgray'>To be completed\nwithin <b>72 hours</b> after</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:blueviolet'> </span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:red'>Priority 1</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:blueviolet'> </span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:dimgray'>and</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:blueviolet'> </span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:forestgreen'>Priority 2</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:blueviolet'> </span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:dimgray'>are complete</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4C4C4C'><br />\n</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:dimgray'>A. Residential\nroads, laneways, and designated sidewalks (lanes may be closed if impractical\nto plow).<br />\nB. Minor facility entrances, pedestrian surfaces, and parking areas.<br />\nC. Major park pathways, trails, and parking lots.</span></p>\n\n<p style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\nnormal;background:white'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\ncolor:dimgray'>D.</span><span style='font-size:13.5pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#333333;background:white'> </span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:dimgray'>Event parking areas (unless a major\nevent is imminent, then priority is raised to clear before the event starts).</span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:darkorchid'><br />\n<br />\n</span><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:orange'>Ministry of\nTransportation &amp; Infrastructure Contractors</span></b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#4C4C4C'><br />\nSnow removal on these routes is completed by Ministry of Transportation &amp; Infrastructure\ncontractors as part of an exchange with the City of Prince George.</span></p>"
